# Everything dbt writes here is generated, and none of it is committed
# (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Data does not go in commits"). target/ holds the
# compiled SQL, the manifest, the run artifacts, and v2's docs site
# (index.html, its assets and Parquet) once `dbt docs generate` has run.
dbt_packages/
logs/
target/
.user.yml
# dbt-oss 2.0.5 appended this line itself on its first `dbt deps` here
# (2026-10-01). The directory never appeared in this sandbox, where deps
# cannot finish, so what v2 keeps in it is unread; it is ignored so that
# wherever v2 does write it, it cannot be committed.
dbt_internal_packages/
